+                "MetaOnPolicyRunner requires a hidden-goal environment (goal position absent from the "
+                "observation); otherwise 'meta-learning' collapses to goal-conditioned RL. Enable "
+                "`env: hidden_goal: true` in the config (or pass --hidden_goal), or set "
+                "`meta: allow_goal_obs: true` for an explicit ablation."
+            )
